# holomorphy, poles (incl. order >= 2) and residues near cuts.
holomorphic sqrt(z)
holomorphic log(z)
holomorphic exp(z)
holomorphic z^(1/2)
holomorphic conj(z)
holomorphic 1/(z-1)
poles 1/(z^2+1)
poles 1/(z^2-1)
poles 1/((z-1)^2*(z+2))
poles 1/(z-1)^2
poles 1/(z-1)^3
poles 1/(z^2-1)^2
residue 1/(z^2+1) at i
residue 1/z at 0
residue log(z)/(z-1) at 1
residue sqrt(z)/(z-1) at 1
residue 1/((z-1)^2*(z+2)) at 1
